    {
      "text": "I have learned by experience, Gen. 30:27. hear my words, that they may learn to fear, Deut. 4:10 (31:13). statutes … that ye may learn them, Deut. 5:1. I have been afflicted; that I might learn thy statutes, Ps. 119:71. A wise man will hear, and will increase learning, Prov. 1:5. teach a just man, and he will increase in learning, Prov. 9:9. Learn to do well, Isa. 1:17. neither shall they learn war any more, Isa. 2:4 (Micah 4:3; 2 Ne. 12:4). deliver to one that is learned, Isa. 29:11 (2 Ne. 27:15–20). they that murmured shall learn doctrine, Isa. 29:24 (2 Ne. 27:35). given me the tongue of the learned, Isa. 50:4. God gave them knowledge and skill in all learning, Dan. 1:17.",
